---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How itwithabbas.com handles your data.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>
        This site is a personal blog. It does not use advertising, tracking cookies or social media pixels.
      </p>
      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Hosting logs:</strong> the host (Cloudflare) processes standard technical data such as IP address and browser type to deliver and protect the site.</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> if you write to me, I keep your message and address only to reply and for as long as the conversation is useful.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If analytics, comments or a newsletter are added later, this page will be updated first.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>To ask what I hold about you or to have it deleted, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
      <p class="muted small">Last updated: October 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
